Again, here is something like the kingdom of heaven. A man was traveling on a journey. He sent his servants to his slaves, and he gave them charge over his possessions.
He gave one $10,000 US dollars, he gave another $4,000 US dollars, and he gave the third $2,000 US dollars. The man gave each servant the amount he knew the servant could handle. He then continued his journey.
