The man who received 10,000 dollars brought the other 10,000 dollars. "Sir," he said, "you trusted me with 10,000 dollars. Look, I have won another 10,000 dollars."
His master answered, "Well done, good and faithful servant! You have been faithful over a little; I will set you over much. Enter into the joy of your master!"
